#: code:addons/l10n_sk_vrp2_account/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"⚠ VRP2 fiscalization of this invoice FAILED: %s\n"
"Issue the fiscal receipt again from the invoice ('Fiscalize in VRP2')."
msgstr ""
"⚠ Fiskalizace této faktury ve VRP2 SELHALA: %s\n"
"Vystavte fiskální doklad znovu z faktury („Fiskalizovat ve VRP2“)."

#. module: l10n_sk_vrp2_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_vrp2_account/models/account_payment_register.py:0
msgid ""
"⚠ VRP2 fiscalization of this invoice's payment FAILED: %s\n"
"The payment was registered; issue the fiscal receipt again from the invoice ('Fiscalize in VRP2')."
msgstr ""
"⚠ Fiskalizace platby této faktury ve VRP2 SELHALA: %s\n"
"Platba byla zaregistrována; vystavte fiskální doklad znovu z faktury („Fiskalizovat ve VRP2“)."

#. module: l10n_sk_vrp2_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_company__vrp2_fiscalize_on_payment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_config_settings__vrp2_fiscalize_on_payment
msgid ""
"When enabled, the standard Register Payment wizard offers a 'Fiscalize in "
"VRP2' option that issues a VRP2 fiscal receipt for the customer-invoice "
"payment it creates. If VRP2 refuses the first receipt nothing is registered;"
" once a receipt has been issued, a later failure keeps the payments and is "
"noted on the invoice to be fiscalized again."
msgstr ""
"Je-li zapnuto, standardní průvodce Registrovat platbu nabídne volbu "
"„Fiskalizovat ve VRP2“, která k platbě vydané faktury, kterou vytvoří, "
"vystaví fiskální doklad VRP2. Pokud VRP2 odmítne první doklad, nic se "
"nezaregistruje; jakmile byl doklad vystaven, pozdější selhání platby zachová"
" a poznamená se na faktuře k opětovné fiskalizaci."

#. module: l10n_sk_vrp2_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_company__vrp2_cash_rounding_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_config_settings__vrp2_cash_rounding_id
msgid "VRP2 cash rounding"
msgstr "Zaokrouhlení hotovosti VRP2"

#. module: l10n_sk_vrp2_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_company__vrp2_cash_rounding_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vrp2_account.field_res_config_settings__vrp2_cash_rounding_id
msgid ""
"Where Register Payment books the 0.05 € rounding of a cash payment it "
"fiscalizes: its profit account when the customer paid more than the invoice,"
" its loss account when less."
msgstr ""
"Kam akce Registrovat platbu zaúčtuje zaokrouhlení na 0,05 € u hotovostní "
"platby, kterou fiskalizuje: na jeho účet zisků, když zákazník zaplatil více,"
" než činí faktura, a na účet ztrát, když zaplatil méně."

#. module: l10n_sk_vrp2_account
